<title>USA: MGM to open New York New York casino Jan 3.</title>
<headline>MGM to open New York New York casino Jan 3.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MGM Grand Inc President and Chief Operating Officer Alex Yemenidjan said Monday the company planned to open the New York, New York hotel and casino in Las Vegas on January 3.</p>
<p>New York, New York is the product of a joint venture between MGM Grand and Primadonna Resorts Inc.</p>
<p>Yemenidjan said the company aimed to double its earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization, to $500 million annually by the time it opens a huge Atlantic City complex, announced this summer.</p>
</text>
